<\/code>) into any post, page, widget area, or layout using the <strong>Shortcode<\/strong> block.":[""],"Design Stylish, Interactive, and Multi-Functional Buttons":[""],"Go to <strong>Button Block &rsaquo; Add New<\/strong>, design your button, and publish it. Copy the shortcode <code>[btn_block id=YOUR_ID]<\/code> from the list table.":[""],"Get multi-functional buttons. The Button Block plugin comes up with many useful styling options that make you happy to build responsive, interactive, stylish buttons in a few clicks.":[""],"Add Shortcode Widget":[""],"Open the Elementor editor on any page. Search for the <strong>Shortcode<\/strong> widget and drag it to your desired section\/column.":[""],"Enter & Preview":[""],"Paste your shortcode (e.g. <code>[btn_block id=123]<\/code>) into the Shortcode input box to preview the stylized button live on the canvas.":[""],"Theme \/ PHP":[""],"Create a Button Post":[""],"Go to <strong>Button Block &rsaquo; Add New<\/strong>, customize your button, and copy the shortcode <code>[btn_block id=YOUR_ID]<\/code> from the post list.":[""],"Button Block Generator":[""],"Open Theme File":[""],"Open the PHP template file in your theme where you want the button to appear (e.g. <code>header.php<\/code>, <code>footer.php<\/code>, <code>single.php<\/code>, or custom template files).":[""],"Render via do_shortcode":[""],"Add <code>&lt;?php echo do_shortcode('[btn_block id=YOUR_ID]'); ?&gt;<\/code> (replace <em>YOUR_ID<\/em> with the actual post ID) to render the button.":[""],"View More Changelogs":[""],"Popup with image, video, docs, or blocks.":[""],"Protect a button by password, email, or role.":[""],"Collect and browse captured email leads.":[""],"Set a custom file name for the download.":[""],"Add rel and referrer policy attributes.":[""],"Place the icon and tooltip on any side.":[""],"Hide the button on desktop, tablet, or mobile.":[""],"See All Demos":[""],"Tooltip":[""],"Icon":[""],"Customize":[""],"Animations":[""],"Popup":[""],"Buy